.Sh CAVEATS
.Fn xft_open
ignores
.Fa mode
on Windows.
.Pp
.Fn xft_lockf
takes a shared lock on Linux and an exclusive lock on Windows.
.Pp
.Fn xft_fcntl
is declared on Windows but has no definition there.
.Pp
.Fa mask
is declared
.Ql const
in
.Fn xft_sched_getaffinity
although it is written.
.Pp
Code using
.Vt t_perf_event_attr
union members must name the union, such as
.Ql attr.period.sample_period ,
in freestanding builds, and must not with
.Dv XFT_LIBC .
